{"id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-normalization-proof.md","title":"Proof Normalization","display":"df-normalization-proof — Proof Normalization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-normalization-proof","aliases":["72-df-normalization-proof"],"display":"df-normalization-proof — Proof Normalization","depends_on":["[[72-df-curry-howard]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, ch.4 print22–27; ch.6 print39–43","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_2026_10_22":"补出强正规化的可达闭合性及存在正规形的ZFC依据"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-normalization-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-normalization-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normalization-proof — Proof Normalization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4628a763a7cdff3f\" href=\"?note=4628a763a7cdff3f\" title=\"72-df-curry-howard\">72-df-curry-howard</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, ch.4 print22–27; ch.6 print39–43"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"补出强正规化的可达闭合性及存在正规形的ZFC依据"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是证明对象的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> 为明确给定的一步归约关系；不预设其正规化或合流。用于类型化自然演绎时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 可取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4628a763a7cdff3f\" href=\"?note=4628a763a7cdff3f\" title=\"72-df-curry-howard\">72-df-curry-howard</a> 的有限推导树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 取其中定义的 detour 归约。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^0\">\\(R^0\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上恒等关系，关系复合约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,z)\\in S\\circ T\\iff\\exists y\\ ((x,y)\\in S\\land(y,z)\\in T)\">\\((x,z)\\in S\\circ T\\iff\\exists y\\ ((x,y)\\in S\\land(y,z)\\in T)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>元理论为ZFC；下列新增式中的x、y均在X中，允许使用依赖选择的集合论推论。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR^{n+1}&amp;:=R^n\\circ R,&amp;R^*&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R^n,\\\\\nx\\to_R y&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Normal}_R(x)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in X\\land\\neg\\exists y\\in X\\ (x\\to_Ry),\\\\\n\\operatorname{WN}_R(x)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in X\\land\\exists y\\in X\\ (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_R(y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SN}_R(x)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in X\\land\\neg\\exists f\\in X^\\omega\\ (f(0)=x\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\langle f(n),f(n+1)\\rangle\\in R),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Normalization}(X,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in X\\ \\operatorname{WN}_R(x).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR^{n+1}&amp;:=R^n\\circ R,&amp;R^*&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R^n,\\\\\nx\\to_R y&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Normal}_R(x)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in X\\land\\neg\\exists y\\in X\\ (x\\to_Ry),\\\\\n\\operatorname{WN}_R(x)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in X\\land\\exists y\\in X\\ (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_R(y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SN}_R(x)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in X\\land\\neg\\exists f\\in X^\\omega\\ (f(0)=x\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\langle f(n),f(n+1)\\rangle\\in R),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Normalization}(X,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in X\\ \\operatorname{WN}_R(x).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x,y\\in X\\quad\\operatorname{SN}_R(x)\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R^*\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{SN}_R(y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x,y\\in X\\quad\\operatorname{SN}_R(x)\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R^*\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{SN}_R(y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in X\\quad\\operatorname{SN}_R(x)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{WN}_R(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in X\\quad\\operatorname{SN}_R(x)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{WN}_R(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是带关系参数的性质定义；具体证明系统的归约另行给出，不能据此推出任意系统正规化。</p>\n<p>若y有无限归约链，将x到y的有限前缀接上即可否定x的强正规化。若x没有可达正规形，则每个从x可达的点都有后继；在这个集合的非空后继集中作选择并自然数迭代，构成从x出发的无限链，矛盾。这里明示ZFC，避免在没有相应选择原则的元理论中静默把无无限链与存在正规形互推。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-curry-howard","status":"resolved","id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-curry-howard]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-curry-howard","status":"resolved","id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ 是证明对象的集合，$R\\subseteq X\\times X$ 为明确给定的一步归约关系；不预设其正规化或合流。用于类型化自然演绎时，$X$ 可取 [[72-df-curry-howard]] 的有限推导树，$R$ 取其中定义的 detour 归约。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"R^0","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"(x,z)\\in S\\circ T\\iff\\exists y\\ ((x,y)\\in S\\land(y,z)\\in T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR^{n+1}&:=R^n\\circ R,&R^*&:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R^n,\\\\\nx\\to_R y&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Normal}_R(x)&:\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in X\\land\\neg\\exists y\\in X\\ (x\\to_Ry),\\\\\n\\operatorname{WN}_R(x)&:\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in X\\land\\exists y\\in X\\ (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_R(y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SN}_R(x)&:\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in X\\land\\neg\\exists f\\in X^\\omega\\ (f(0)=x\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\langle f(n),f(n+1)\\rangle\\in R),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Normalization}(X,R)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in X\\ \\operatorname{WN}_R(x).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x,y\\in X\\quad\\operatorname{SN}_R(x)\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R^*\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{SN}_R(y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in X\\quad\\operatorname{SN}_R(x)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{WN}_R(x).","display":true}],"bytes":2658,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-399","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-normalization-proof|df-normalization-proof — Proof Normalization]]"},{"id":"9f91888dacef2bdf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 是集合，$R\\subseteq X^2$，$R^*$ 如 [[72-df-normalization-proof]]。"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-397","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-normalization-proof — Proof Normalization](72-df-normalization-proof.md)"},{"id":"9cb1e684c866136a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 是集合，$R\\subseteq X\\times X$；$\\operatorname{SN}_R$ 使用 [[72-df-normalization-proof]] 中无无限归约链的定义。"},{"id":"97a98663b21af886","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-433","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-normalization-proof|df-normalization-proof — Proof Normalization]]"},{"id":"3a355fde5140d919","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\to}M:A$、合法项集与 $\\beta_\\lambda$ 取自 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]。$\\operatorname{SN}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{Normal}_R$ 见 [[72-df-normalization-proof]]。"},{"id":"99aa8943f30c6e5e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A$、合法项集与 $\\beta_F$ 取自 [[72-df-system-f]]。$\\operatorname{SN}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{Normal}_R$ 见 [[72-df-normalization-proof]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-normalization-proof]]"}],"outgoing":["4628a763a7cdff3f"]}